## Features
- 200 cool white LEDs with 8 lighting modes;
- 3-piece deer family with rainbow effects;
- Sturdy powder-coated metal frame;
- 6H on/18H off daily timer for effortless lighting;
- Weather-resistant rattan with no glitter or mess;

## Information
Transform your home into a magical winter scene with this 3-piece iridescent reindeer family. Reflective PET strips, cool white LEDs, 8 lighting modes and a timer create a dazzling holiday display. IP44-rated with a safe low-voltage adapter, it's ideal for porches and yards.
